  "body": "`CanvasDrawImage.drawImage` accepts elements as source of image, but it doesn't seem to be completely clear whether it is using the underlying image data, or the rendering of the element. Based on current implementation it seems to be the former. In that case it might be good to mention that styles such as `filter` etc. applied on the element would not affect what's get painted via this method.",
